<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This is a macro that has been created with the aim to be used to semi automate horizontal crop farming on the hypixel server, specifcally in their skyblock gamemode. 

Farm Specifications:
Farm size: 163 blocks x 163 blocks
Speed stat: 245 speed
Crops: Can be used for Cocoa Beans (Angle the cursor upwards), Potato, Carrot, Wheat, Cactus, Mushroom and Nether wart.
Recommend building multiple layers of farm with teleport pads so that you can infinitely farm.

How to use: Cocoa Beans

1. Angle your cursor directly upwards with the cocoa beans set above you
2. Make sure that your angle (Press F3 to find this info) is 90/-90
3. Start the macro and it will afk farm

How to use: Every other crop listed

1. Angle your cursor at the angle 90/-1
2. Make sure that the crops are raised one block off the ground so that they are at your resting eye level.
3. Start Macro and it will afk farm for you.


Other Hypixel Skyblock Farm Macros:
Suagr Cane: https://botmek.com/share/?file=KEifJArjP6lrJo7</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
KeyDown 22 1
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 23500 ms
KeyUp 22 1
KeyUp 4 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 3 s
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 22 1
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 22 1
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 23500 ms
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 3 s
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 2 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Minecraft</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>